              "character": "jim",
              "mode": "told",
              "content": "Della says she has had her hair cut off and sold it because she could not live through Christmas without giving him a present, and that it will grow out again."
            },
            {
              "character": "della",
              "mode": "witnessed"
            }
          ],
          "location": "flat"
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "round": 4,
          "text": "Jim asked, as if dazed, whether she had cut off her hair and whether it was gone; Della said it was sold and gone, and asked if she should put the chops on.",
          "importance": 3,
          "tags": [
            "hair",
            "daze"
