          "items": [
            "combs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "turn": 6,
          "round": 8,
          "text": "Della hugged the combs to her and said 'My hair grows so fast, Jim!', then leapt up and held out the chain on her palm, asking Jim for his watch to see how it looked.",
          "importance": 4,
          "tags": [
